{"title": "Tu'narath's Embrace", "pageid": 45115, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tu'narath's_Embrace", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Class actions", "Actions", "Legendary actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp/300px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp, /w/images/8/8d/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp/300px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Tu'narath's Embrace</b> is a legendary action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a> in Honour mode. She can use this reaction once per round to dispel crowd control effects from an ally.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nProtect an ally that is targeted by an incapacitating condition<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup> with an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\">Embrace</a> that also grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"50 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Action triggered by reaction</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_GithyankiPaladin_VlaakithsCry\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Reaction which triggers the action</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Tu.27narath.27s_Embrace\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Tu'narath's_Embrace\"> Condition: Tu'narath's Embrace </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\">Tu'narath's Embrace</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature was blessed by a nearby Ch'r'ai, it cannot be affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">incapacitating conditions</a> and received <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"50 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace\">Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The immunity to incapacitating conditions extends to everything in the <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Stunned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Stunned\">Stunned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Fleeing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Fleeing\">Fleeing</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Unconscious\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Unconscious\">Unconscious</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Restrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Restrained\">Restrained</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone</a> status groups.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2826/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42723/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16799/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1273464/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusi